---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact V1 - Axiomet"
  description=""
>
<section class="section inner-hero"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="home-hero-content-wrap inner-hero"><div class="inner-hero-left contact"><div class="inner-hero-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">LET’S BUILD WHAT’S NEXT</div></div><h1 class="inner-hero-heading">Have a complex problem?<br/>Let’s work through it.</h1></div><div class="inner-hero-right contact"><p class="paragraph-regular">Tell us what you’re building, where you’re stuck, or what you want to improve. We’ll help you find the clearest path forward.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="contact-wrap"><div class="section-header impact-v2"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">START A CONVERSATION</div></div><div class="max-width-38"><h2 class="section-heading">Tell us what you’re working on.</h2></div><p data-to-top="2" class="font-regular contact-head">Give us a look at the challenge you’re facing, and let’s explore what the right solution could look like.</p></div><div class="contact-form-wrap"><div data-to-top="0" class="contact-form-card"><div class="contact-form-block w-form"><form id="wf-form-Contact-Form-V1" name="wf-form-Contact-Form-V1" data-name="Contact Form V1" method="get" class="contact-form" data-wf-page-id="6ac63e0964233867b3888e72" data-wf-element-id="f3a5c01e-a249-b456-f6c1-31e492d0f20a" data-turnstile-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAAQTptj2So4dx43e"><div class="contact-form-fields"><div class="contact-form-row"><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="name" class="contact-form-label">Name</label><input class="contact-form-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Your name" type="text" id="name" required=""/></div><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="" class="contact-form-label">Name</label><input class="contact-form-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="Name 2" data-name="Name 2" placeholder="Your name" type="text" id="name-2" required=""/></div></div><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="work-email" class="contact-form-label">Work Email</label><input class="contact-form-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="Work Email" data-name="Work Email" placeholder="you@company.com" type="email" id="work-email" required=""/></div><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="company" class="contact-form-label">Company</label><input class="contact-form-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="Company" data-name="Company" placeholder="Company name" type="text" id="company"/></div><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="" class="contact-form-label">Project Type</label><div class="contact-select-wrap"><select id="project-type" name="Project-Type" data-name="Project-Type" required="" class="contact-form-input select w-select"><option value="">Select a project type</option><option value="Technology Strategy">Technology Strategy</option><option value="Systems &amp; Product Engineering">Systems </option><option value="AI &amp; Intelligent Systems">AI </option><option value="Product &amp; Innovation">Product </option><option value="Other">Other</option></select><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" width="100%" class="contact-select-icon"><path d="M5.66667 7.99951L9.83333 12.1662L14 7.99951" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="contact-form-field"><label for="message" class="contact-form-label">Message</label><textarea required="" placeholder="What are you trying to build, solve, or improve?" maxlength="5000" id="message" name="Message" data-name="Message" class="contact-form-input textarea w-input"></textarea></div><div class="font-small">We’ll review your message and get back to you within 1–2 business days.</div></div><div class="contact-submit-wrap"><input type="submit" data-wait="Sending..." class="primary-button contact-submit w-button" value="Send Project Inquiry"/><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow contact-submit"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></form><div class="contact-form-success w-form-done"><div class="font-regular">Thank you! Your project inquiry has been received. We’ll get back to you within 1–2 business days.</div></div><div class="contact-form-error w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Please try again.</div></div></div></div><div class="contact-info-grid"><div data-to-top="0" class="about-stats-card contact"><div class="about-icon-wrap case-work"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="100%" class="about-card-icon v2"><path d="M7 7.5L9.94202 9.23943C11.6572 10.2535 12.3428 10.2535 14.058 9.23943L17 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M21.996 10C21.9933 9.63328 21.9894 9.77017 21.9842 9.5265C21.9189 6.46005 21.8862 4.92682 20.7551 3.79105C19.6239 2.65528 18.0497 2.61571 14.9012 2.53658C12.9607 2.48781 11.0393 2.48781 9.09882 2.53657C5.95033 2.6157 4.37608 2.65526 3.24495 3.79103C2.11382 4.92681 2.08114 6.46003 2.01576 9.52648C1.99474 10.5125 1.99475 11.4926 2.01577 12.4786C2.08114 15.5451 2.11383 17.0783 3.24496 18.2141C4.37608 19.3498 5.95033 19.3894 9.09883 19.4685C9.7068 19.4838 10.4957 19.4943 11 19.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15.5861 18.6482C14.9573 19.0167 13.3087 19.7693 14.3128 20.711C14.8033 21.171 15.3496 21.5 16.0365 21.5H19.9557C20.6425 21.5 21.1888 21.171 21.6793 20.711C22.6835 19.7693 21.0348 19.0167 20.406 18.6482C18.9315 17.7839 17.0606 17.7839 15.5861 18.6482Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path><path d="M19.9961 14C19.9961 15.1046 19.1006 16 17.9961 16C16.8915 16 15.9961 15.1046 15.9961 14C15.9961 12.8954 16.8915 12 17.9961 12C19.1006 12 19.9961 12.8954 19.9961 14Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap contact"><div class="font-extra-normal case-work">Phone</div><a href="tel:(308)555-0121" class="font-small help">(308) 555-0121</a></div></div><div data-to-top="2" class="about-stats-card contact"><div class="about-icon-wrap case-work"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="100%" class="about-card-icon v2"><path d="M7 7.5L9.94202 9.23943C11.6572 10.2535 12.3428 10.2535 14.058 9.23943L17 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M21.996 10C21.9933 9.63328 21.9894 9.77017 21.9842 9.5265C21.9189 6.46005 21.8862 4.92682 20.7551 3.79105C19.6239 2.65528 18.0497 2.61571 14.9012 2.53658C12.9607 2.48781 11.0393 2.48781 9.09882 2.53657C5.95033 2.6157 4.37608 2.65526 3.24495 3.79103C2.11382 4.92681 2.08114 6.46003 2.01576 9.52648C1.99474 10.5125 1.99475 11.4926 2.01577 12.4786C2.08114 15.5451 2.11383 17.0783 3.24496 18.2141C4.37608 19.3498 5.95033 19.3894 9.09883 19.4685C9.7068 19.4838 10.4957 19.4943 11 19.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15.5861 18.6482C14.9573 19.0167 13.3087 19.7693 14.3128 20.711C14.8033 21.171 15.3496 21.5 16.0365 21.5H19.9557C20.6425 21.5 21.1888 21.171 21.6793 20.711C22.6835 19.7693 21.0348 19.0167 20.406 18.6482C18.9315 17.7839 17.0606 17.7839 15.5861 18.6482Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path><path d="M19.9961 14C19.9961 15.1046 19.1006 16 17.9961 16C16.8915 16 15.9961 15.1046 15.9961 14C15.9961 12.8954 16.8915 12 17.9961 12C19.1006 12 19.9961 12.8954 19.9961 14Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap contact"><div class="font-extra-normal case-work">Email</div><a href="mailto:hello@axiomet.com" class="font-small help">hello@axiomet.com</a></div></div><div data-to-top="4" class="about-stats-card contact"><div class="about-icon-wrap case-work"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="100%" class="about-card-icon v2"><path d="M10.0808 2C5.47023 2.9359 2 7.01218 2 11.899C2 17.4776 6.52238 22 12.101 22C16.9878 22 21.0641 18.5298 22 13.9192" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M18.9375 18C19.3216 17.9166 19.6771 17.784 20 17.603M14.6875 17.3406C15.2831 17.6015 15.8576 17.7948 16.4051 17.9218M10.8546 14.9477C11.2681 15.238 11.71 15.5861 12.1403 15.8865M3 13.825C3.32234 13.6675 3.67031 13.4868 4.0625 13.3321M6.45105 13C7.01293 13.0624 7.64301 13.2226 8.35743 13.5232" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M18.5 7C18.5 6.17157 17.8284 5.5 17 5.5C16.1716 5.5 15.5 6.17157 15.5 7C15.5 7.82843 16.1716 8.5 17 8.5C17.8284 8.5 18.5 7.82843 18.5 7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path><path d="M17 2C19.7059 2 22 4.21814 22 6.90917C22 9.64306 19.6685 11.5616 17.515 12.8662C17.3581 12.9539 17.1806 13 17 13C16.8194 13 16.6419 12.9539 16.485 12.8662C14.3355 11.5489 12 9.65251 12 6.90917C12 4.21814 14.2941 2 17 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path></svg></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap contact"><div class="font-extra-normal case-work">Location</div><div class="font-small remote">Global / Remote</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="section-gap"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-row contact"><div class="section-header _w-w-work v2"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</div></div><div class="max-width-28"><h2 class="section-heading">A simple start to a complex project.</h2></div></div><div data-to-top="2"><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="bg-white" data-wf-component-id="4c762986-7cae-1c12-bec9-1ecbb760ee61" data-wf-variant-state="21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4" href="/contact-v1" aria-current="page" class="primary-button w-variant-21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4 w-inline-block w--current"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="button-text is-one">Start a Project</div><div class="button-text is-two">Start a Project</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div></div><div class="about-row contact-step"><div data-to-top="0" class="about-image-wrap contact-step"><img class="about-image v2" src="/images/6ac74a30574f89a5e89f83f1_Frame%202147227629%20(7)%20(1).webp" alt="Close-up of dark precision-engineered hardware" sizes="100vw" data-parallax="true" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/6ac74a30574f89a5e89f83f1_Frame%202147227629%20(7)%20(1)-p-500.webp 500w, /images/6ac74a30574f89a5e89f83f1_Frame%202147227629%20(7)%20(1)-p-800.webp 800w, /images/6ac74a30574f89a5e89f83f1_Frame%202147227629%20(7)%20(1)-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/6ac74a30574f89a5e89f83f1_Frame%202147227629%20(7)%20(1).webp 2028w"/></div><div class="about-stats-grid contact-step"><div data-to-top="0" class="about-stats-card about-principle contact-step"><div class="how-we-work-number"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">01.</div></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap help"><h3 class="font-extra-normal help">We Listen</h3><p class="font-small help">You share the challenge, opportunity, or idea you&#x27;re working through.</p></div></div><div data-to-top="2" class="about-stats-card about-principle contact-step"><div class="how-we-work-number"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">02.</div></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap help"><h3 class="font-extra-normal help">We Understand</h3><p class="font-small help">We look at the technical, business, and strategic context behind it.</p></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="about-stats-card about-principle contact-step"><div class="how-we-work-number"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">03.</div></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap help"><h3 class="font-extra-normal help">We Respond</h3><p class="font-small help">We come back with an initial perspective and the clearest next step.</p></div></div><div data-to-top="2" class="about-stats-card about-principle contact-step"><div class="how-we-work-number"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">04.</div></div><div class="about-card-info-wrap help"><h3 class="font-extra-normal help">We Move Forward</h3><p class="font-small help">If there’s a fit, we define the right way to work together.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section black-800"><div class="section-gap contact-faq"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="section-header left"><div class="section-badge"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="badge-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</div></div><div class="max-width-42 faq-v3"><h2 class="section-heading small">A few answers to help you understand how we work, where we can help, and what to expect from an AXIOMET engagement.</h2></div></div><div class="faq-wrapper"><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">01.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What does AXIOMET actually do?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">AXIOMET helps technology-driven companies solve complex challenges across strategy, engineering, AI, and intelligent systems—from defining the right direction to building scalable solutions.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">02.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What types of companies do you work with?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Our clients range from venture-backed startups shipping a first device to established manufacturers and software firms that need deeper engineering capacity for their most critical programs.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">03.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Can AXIOMET help us if we only have an idea?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">Yes. Share your idea through our contact form and we will set up a short call, map what must be true for it to work, and send back a written outline of the first steps worth taking.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">04.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">Do you provide strategy or actual engineering support?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">We provide both. An engagement can begin with a focused strategy phase or move straight into delivery, with our architects and engineers embedded in your team for as long as you need them.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">05.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">How do you approach a complex technical problem?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">First we listen and audit what already exists, then split the problem into testable parts, rank them by risk, and validate the critical ones through models, prototypes, or field pilots.</p></div></div></div><div data-to-top="0" class="faq-card v3"><div class="faq-left-main v2"><div class="faq-left"><div class="impact-number-wrap"><div class="pill-dot"></div><div class="font-extra-small">06.</div></div></div></div><div class="faq-right v3 last"><div class="faq-card-top v2"><div class="font-normal">What makes AXIOMET different from a traditional consultancy?</div><div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon"><path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div class="faq-summary-wrap"><p class="faq-summary">A traditional consultancy usually hands over a report. We stay accountable for results—the people who scope your project also design, build, and test it alongside your own engineers.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
